@subsection controller_section Controller - Control Engine for UR3e Piano Playing
**@ref UR_README.md "Controller"** - Usage Guide

The Controller class in the Control namespace is responsible for all direct ROS2 interaction with the robots UR_DRIVER and MoveIt Servo libraries.
It exposes no public members to be interacted with and as such must be controlled via its various ROS2 Interfaces (See Usage Guide above).

\subsubsection Behaviour
Before Starting the node, it assumes that you have followed the Intallation, Physical Robot Setup and Software Setup sections defined in the Usage Guide.
Without all that infrastructure running, the Node will be unable to function.
